=== TITLE: USG Obstetric Evaluation for IUFD ===
=== IMPRESSION ===
INTRAUTERINE FOETAL DEMISE (IUFD).
- Single intrauterine gestation showing absence of foetal cardiac pulsation and somatic movements.

=== FINDINGS ===
STUDY: OBSTETRIC ULTRASONOGRAPHY FOR FOETAL VIABILITY EVALUATION

OBSERVATIONS:
- GESTATIONAL EVALUATION: Single intrauterine fetus visualized in variable presentation.
- CARDIAC ACTIVITY: Absolute absence of foetal cardiac motion verified on real-time 2D, M-mode, and Color Doppler interrogation.
- FOETAL MOVEMENTS: No somatic or respiratory movements detected during prolonged observation.
- CRANIAL & SPINAL SIGNS: Cranial bones show early overlapping of sutures (Spalding's sign).
- AMNIOTIC FLUID: Reduced liquor volume (Oligohydramnios).
- PLACENTA: Thickened with early degenerative retroplacental changes.